          `📊 *የመገኘት መረጃና ክትትል (Attendance Overview)*\n` +
          `👤 *ተማሪ:* ${studentName || msg.from?.first_name || 'ተማሪ'} ${studentCode ? `(\`${studentCode}\`)` : ''}\n` +
          `═══════════════════════\n` +
          `📈 *የተገኝነት ምጣኔ (Attendance Rate):* *${rate}%*\n` +
          `${progressBar}\n\n` +
